{"id":"1e8833fe3ee6","path":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/documents","lang":"en","title":"Key documents for our researchers","description":"Questa sezione consente un accesso rapido ai documenti utili ai ricercatori USI impegnati in attività di trasferimento tecnologico. Per qualunque domanda contattare USI Transfer.","section":"Innovation","crumbs":["Innovation","Innovate","USI Transfer","For Researchers"],"image":null,"words":96,"alternates":{"it":"/it/innovazione/innovare/usi-transfer/ricercatori/documenti","en":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/documents"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Innovation","path":"/en/originalnode/23939"},{"label":"Innovate","path":"/en/originalnode/23935"},{"label":"USI Transfer","path":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer"},{"label":"For Researchers","path":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/support"},{"label":"Key documents for our researchers","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>This page provides quick access to all essential documents for USI researchers involved in technology transfer activities.<br> For any question please contact <a href=\"mailto:usitransfer@usi.ch\">USI Transfer</a>.</p> <p><strong>Intellectual Property documentation</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/14596\">Policy on Technology and Knowledge Transfer</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/26403\">Informational Document for Intellectual Property Licensing to Spin-off Companies</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/26403\">Invention disclosure form</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/26403\">Software disclosure form</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>Patent drafting</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/26403\">How to draft a patent application: a practical guide for academic inventors.</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/26403\"><em>Vademecum </em>for inventors on how to prepare a patent application (BIOTECH)</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/26403\"><em>Vademecum </em>for inventors on how to prepare a patent application (SOFTWARE and AI)</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>Scientific services</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/en/originalnode/26403\">General terms and condition for scientific services</a></li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"USI Transfer","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer"},{"label":"Mission","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/mission"},{"label":"Team","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/team"},{"label":"Intellectual Property","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/intellectual-property"},{"label":"Success Stories","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/success-stories"},{"label":"Useful Links","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/useful-links"},{"label":"Contact","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/contact"},{"label":"Licensing Opportunities","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/licensing-opportunities"},{"label":"Industrial Agreements","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/industrial-agreements"},{"label":"Collaborate with us","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/partners-innovation"},{"label":"Support","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/support"},{"label":"Grant Support","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/grant-support"},{"label":"Documents","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/documents"},{"label":"For Startups","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/startup"},{"label":"News on Technology Transfer","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/news"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/documents","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T18:02:41.969Z"}